		{"id":"c44852c5b85257cc","type":"text","text":"## *Viessmann*\n\nViessmann is a heat pump and heating solution OEM that also offers maintenance contracts for the consumers. Website outlines that they service primarily for the commercial and residential sector at a larger scale, but only provide the equipment (and installation), but does not go into system operation.","x":-1365,"y":-1360,"width":385,"height":140,"color":"1"},
